{% extends 'site/guideBase.html.twig' %}
{% block content %}
    <div class="uw-card">
        <div class="uw-card-header">Federations</div>
        <div class="uw-card-body">
            <p>
                A federation is an alliance of players working together. You can join an existing federation or create your own.
                Federation members can send aid to each other, share resources through the federation bank, and coordinate their efforts.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <br/>

    <div class="uw-card">
        <div class="uw-card-header">Federation Features</div>
        <div class="uw-card-body">
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <b>Federation News:</b> A feed of all activity in your federation, including attacks, aid shipments, and member changes.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <b>Send Aid:</b> Send resources to federation members to help them out.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <b>Federation Bank:</b> A shared treasury where members can deposit and withdraw cash and resources.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <b>Leader Message:</b> The federation leader can set a message visible to all members.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <b>Applications:</b> Players can apply to join your federation. The leader can accept or deny applications.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <b>Leave Federation:</b> You can leave your federation at any time (unless you are the leader).
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <br/>

    <div class="uw-card">
        <div class="uw-card-header">Federation Ranks</div>
        <div class="uw-card-body">
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <b>General (Leader):</b> Full control over the federation. Can change settings, accept or kick members, change ranks, manage the federation bank, change the federation name and leader message, and disband the federation. Only one player can be General.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <b>Captain:</b> Mid-rank member with federation bank permissions. Can see federation news, donate to and withdraw from the federation bank, and send aid to members.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <b>Recruit:</b> The starting rank when you join a federation. Can see federation news, donate to the federation bank, and send aid to members. Cannot withdraw from the bank or change federation settings.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
